{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c064d082-d9ac-888a-b524-1eb7683aee0e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T11:47:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:39:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Sure, thanks for picking up. I'm calling about some trash that got left out on the curb, um, bulk stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bulk waste. Can you tell me a little more about what happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:39:53-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. So, the landlord, he had a tenant move out of the unit next to mine, and he just put everything on the curb. A mattress, a couple of chairs, a broken dresser, some bags. It's been out there since the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so a mattress, chairs, a dresser, and bags, left by the landlord after a move-out. And where is this, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:40:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. It's 55 Brewer Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "55 Brewer Street. Is that in the Fifth Ward?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yeah, that's right, the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And are you the owner of the building, or are you in the neighboring unit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, so I own my place, I'm a homeowner. It's the house next to the landlord's rental, I mean the unit is, um, it's the same building but separate. He owns the other side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:41:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So you live there, and the landlord owns the other half and he's the one who put the items out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So bulk items usually need to be scheduled or tagged, they're not just picked up with the regular trash. Has anybody from the city been out to look at it, or has a notice gone on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:42:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nothing that I've seen. No sticker, nothing. Sure, I looked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:42:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll make a note of it so it gets looked at. Was there anything else mixed in, like electronics or paint or anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, let me think. There's a TV, I think, an old flat one, on the side by the chairs. No paint that I saw."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A TV. Okay, I'll put that in too, because those get handled differently."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:42:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:42:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what I'm hearing is you'd like to know when the next regular pickup is on your street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:43:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, absolutely, that's the other thing. When's the next pickup for us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:43:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the schedule for Brewer Street. One moment. [pause] Okay, I'm seeing that your trash day is Thursday. Does that sound right to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday, yes. Sure. That sounds right, it's usually Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And recycling is the alternating week. Based on the calendar, recycling would be this Thursday as well, so both are going out this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, of course. So both Thursday, this Thursday. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:43:57-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. But I want to be clear, the regular crew may not take the mattress and the furniture. Those are the bulk items. I'm going to send a request over so someone can check it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, no, that's what I figured. I just don't want it sitting there all week. My kid walks by it going to the bus, you know, and it's just, it's a mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. How old is your child, if you don't mind my asking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:44:47-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, he's thirteen. He's, uh, he keeps asking me for these sneakers, they're like two hundred and something dollars. I keep saying no. Absolutely not. He can wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:45:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, that's a lot for a thirteen-year-old's feet, they'll grow out of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:45:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yeah, exactly. Anyway, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's fine. So let me read back what I have. 55 Brewer Street, bulk waste at the curb, a mattress, chairs, a dresser, a flat TV, and some bags, left by the landlord after a tenant moved out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:45:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, perfect, absolutely. That's everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:45:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the best number to reach you, in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:45:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0181. Okay. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:46:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Luis Ortiz. O-R-T-I-Z."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Ortiz. Luis with an S?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:46:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, with an S, of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:46:18-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So I'll send this to the crew supervisor. Usually someone checks it within a few days. If the landlord is the one responsible, the city may follow up with him directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:46:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that makes sense. Do I need to do anything else, or, um, should I call him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:46:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You don't have to. If you'd like to mention it to him, that's up to you, but the request will go in either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, absolutely. I'll leave it then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:47:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And in the meantime, if the pile spreads into the sidewalk or the street, call us back so we can note it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:47:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, yes. Will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help you with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:47:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you very much, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:47:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Ortiz. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:47:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, absolutely. Bye now."
    }
  ],
